skyfighter (Sky Fighter): credits and licences

The game (src/, shaders/foliage.mjs, tools/) is MIT with this repository. Its assets are generated by
the tools in tools/ from these sources, or made for the game:

  F-15 Eagle model, Innerscene, CC0
    https://www.innerscene.com/tools/library/3d-parts/f-15-eagle-fighter-jet-e1d11142
    assets/models/*; tools/build-wreck-parts.py cuts the wreck sections and their collision bounds
  Terrain surface scans from Poly Haven, CC0: Aerial Rocks 02, Aerial Grass Rock, Snow 03,
    coast sand 01, sand 03, factory wall, concrete wall 009
    https://polyhaven.com/a/aerial_rocks_02  https://polyhaven.com/a/aerial_grass_rock
    https://polyhaven.com/a/snow_03  https://polyhaven.com/a/coast_sand_01  https://polyhaven.com/a/sand_03
    https://polyhaven.com/a/factory_wall  https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_wall_009
    tools/build-terrain-layers.py downloads the 4K scans into deps/ and packs assets/terrain/*
  Inland relief: Mapzen/Tilezen Terrain Tiles (AWS Open Data), sampled near Grindelwald.
    https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/
    Europe elevation data produced using Copernicus data and information funded by the European
    Union, EU-DEM layers. The coast is fictional: the relief is translated, scaled and graded around
    the airfield. tools/fetch-alpine-height.py produces the offline height data.
  Afterburner and flyby audio: excerpts of "F101 / T-9 Jet Engine Test Cell", Timothy Kirchner,
    U.S. Air Force, public domain
    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:F101_-_T-9_Jet_Engine_Test_Cell.ogv
    tools/build-engine-audio.py filters, normalises and crossfades the loops (assets/audio)
  Architectural facade atlas and the tree material atlas: generated with an image generation tool
    for this game; the prompts and the source images are in assets/source-architecture/ and
    assets/source-trees/; the runtime textures are assets/textures/*.jpg
  assets/effects/billow.png: generated for this game
  The trees' geometry: tools/build-tree-models.py (src/tree-meshes.h)
  The sound effects and the music: made by the game's code and tools

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence files beside them in assets/fonts):
  Russo One, Oswald

Engine: cartwheel-engine (MIT) and three.c (MIT), as shipped with this repository's build. The
program tables under programs/ carry the engine samples' and the terrain demo's states the game
shares (cw_samples.txt, terrain_demo.txt) beside its own.
